Third-party data
----------------
The files in scores/ are word statistics generated from these datasets.
The datasets themselves are not included in this repository.

- Amazon MASSIVE 1.1 (https://github.com/alexa/massive)
  Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates. Licensed under CC BY 4.0.
- CLINC150 / oos-eval (https://github.com/clinc/oos-eval)
  By the CLINC150 authors (Larson et al., 2019). Licensed under
  Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported.
- SNIPS NLU benchmark (https://github.com/sonos/nlu-benchmark)
  Released under CC0 1.0.

Personality phrases are drawn from public-domain books (published before
1929), read from Project Gutenberg plain-text copies. The titles are listed
in defaults/examples/personality/sources.yaml (personality/sources.yaml on an
install).

